{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/extras/5d101b8b7f8e9ab7d2a4e363a1daac10.avif?t=1762097874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/extras_big/5d101b8b7f8e9ab7d2a4e363a1daac10.avif?t=1762097874 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna and the Sea</strong> is a beautifully hand-drawn-style, story-driven <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong> set in <strong>17th-century Amsterdam</strong>. You play as <strong>Luna</strong>, a young girl surviving alone on the streets, who embarks on a journey across the sea to find her long-lost father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only her wits and kindness, Luna navigates a world that is both cruel and wondrous, encountering characters who are struggling just like her. Every choice matters\u2014will you help those in need, or look out only for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first chapter introduces players to Luna\u2019s world, where <strong>puzzles, exploration, and heartfelt storytelling</strong> blend seamlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich narrative adventure</strong> \u2013 Experience a heartwarming yet bittersweet story about hope, loss, and resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic point-and-click gameplay</strong> \u2013 Solve puzzles, interact with unique characters, and explore a historically inspired setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn art style</strong> \u2013 A visually distinctive, pencil-drawn world that feels like stepping into a child\u2019s dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s interactions shape her journey, rewarding kindness and cleverness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic hint system</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s only friend, the <strong>moon</strong>, gently guides her when she\u2019s lost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by humans with the help of AI.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Yum, berries!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/7ffbd25f4443974c01ed73095a67e431ea755774.jpg"},{"name":"Such a blue oyster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/109434ff7cb1c892d46f2c4d55a2de1411b4ca83.jpg"},{"name":"The girl with the pearl earring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/c00ce300cfa8139668d8b1334fc590ea2e149845.jpg"},{"name":"The milkmaid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/506bab883d1227009a3c47420a693f488373caf4.jpg"},{"name":"The girl reading a letter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/9e1d18edab7279f55814d195cde3c07c8c550d74.jpg"},{"name":"Moon, I need a hint!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/244e110c3e385e7fc4b4aba66497b6260cfe831f.jpg"},{"name":"An official purchase order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/fc0b6dfa3855f7586255b61711e6f2c3dfb81671.jpg"},{"name":"A smart girl needs no help","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/8878fa1d14fcff0fdef5c020f07b17aab4f4803a.jpg"},{"name":"Setting sail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/a667c74e13db9ad12ebb5d313fb415503012b200.jpg"},{"name":"That was good for nothing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583780/44b7f290ed90eec8d85066936e6684cc0dfc44b5.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583780?t=1762097874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/a89d3ffc666e1b528866863dc92a1ebcfa09e936/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762097874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/018849c4bca74b0beede4678a498df022e9ec739/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762097874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/018849c4bca74b0beede4678a498df022e9ec739/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762097874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/extras/5d101b8b7f8e9ab7d2a4e363a1daac10.avif?t=1762097874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/extras_big/5d101b8b7f8e9ab7d2a4e363a1daac10.avif?t=1762097874 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna and the Sea</strong> is a beautifully hand-drawn-style, story-driven <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong> set in <strong>17th-century Amsterdam</strong>. You play as <strong>Luna</strong>, a young girl surviving alone on the streets, who embarks on a journey across the sea to find her long-lost father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only her wits and kindness, Luna navigates a world that is both cruel and wondrous, encountering characters who are struggling just like her. Every choice matters\u2014will you help those in need, or look out only for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first chapter introduces players to Luna\u2019s world, where <strong>puzzles, exploration, and heartfelt storytelling</strong> blend seamlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich narrative adventure</strong> \u2013 Experience a heartwarming yet bittersweet story about hope, loss, and resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic point-and-click gameplay</strong> \u2013 Solve puzzles, interact with unique characters, and explore a historically inspired setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn art style</strong> \u2013 A visually distinctive, pencil-drawn world that feels like stepping into a child\u2019s dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s interactions shape her journey, rewarding kindness and cleverness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic hint system</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s only friend, the <strong>moon</strong>, gently guides her when she\u2019s lost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by humans with the help of AI.</p>","developers":["Voidance"],"dlc":[3614350,3614360,3614370],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/41b380ca607bf83e4ce6882b3b737374c5790209/header.jpg?t=1762097874","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 10 and newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583780/847392/532e055f33514626c2e3c1b83cbd525f524ac0f1/1750461218/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741959964","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.stea